{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/f779b2fd527f9ff7a109398051c2a301.avif?t=1752598678\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/d26fa5e738680a9959c457d6336f7e1a.poster.avif?t=1752598678\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/d26fa5e738680a9959c457d6336f7e1a.webm?t=1752598678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/d26fa5e738680a9959c457d6336f7e1a.mp4?t=1752598678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a detective working for the police. Your current mission: locate a massive, <strong>abandoned facility</strong> hidden deep within a Russian forest. According to scattered reports, the place was used for highly suspicious activities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To reach the depths, you'll descend countless floors sometimes by<strong> rusted elevator</strong>. The facility is vast, spanning numerous levels. Each level is completely different and hides its own challenges, surprises and dangerous entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You don\u2019t know what awaits in the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But you will \u2014 soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/fdc15420b3902483af295efff544c08c.avif?t=1752598678\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/68db13095efe871a0fcead17a7a1dd2d.poster.avif?t=1752598678\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/68db13095efe871a0fcead17a7a1dd2d.webm?t=1752598678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/68db13095efe871a0fcead17a7a1dd2d.mp4?t=1752598678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are equipped with a <strong>photo camera</strong> and a high-tech objective-finding device known as <strong>S.E.R.A</strong> (<strong>Spectral Emission Recognition Apparatus)</strong> \u2014 capable of detecting nearby objects with fingerprints or fresh blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your task: <strong>find and photograph every clue</strong> that could help the investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/1c7817f7ffaa61ee9cd3b1aff276db21.avif?t=1752598678\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout your descent, you\u2019ll need to solve <strong>puzzles</strong>, uncover new <strong>challenges</strong>\u00a0and gather <strong>equipment</strong> to go deeper. There are <strong>collectibles</strong>\u00a0and other secrets scattered along the way. Every level may bring you closer to the truth \u2014 or further into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you reach the bottom you\u2019ll know everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You <strong>must</strong> do this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no other way.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3481510?t=1752598678","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/3b67335073b086f24958ad11c8f2aefe5a6434ea/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752598678","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/86d94113ef857864c9619299df73ec8765c49bf0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752598678","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/86d94113ef857864c9619299df73ec8765c49bf0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752598678","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/f779b2fd527f9ff7a109398051c2a301.avif?t=1752598678\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/d26fa5e738680a9959c457d6336f7e1a.poster.avif?t=1752598678\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/d26fa5e738680a9959c457d6336f7e1a.webm?t=1752598678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/d26fa5e738680a9959c457d6336f7e1a.mp4?t=1752598678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a detective working for the police. Your current mission: locate a massive, <strong>abandoned facility</strong> hidden deep within a Russian forest. According to scattered reports, the place was used for highly suspicious activities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To reach the depths, you'll descend countless floors sometimes by<strong> rusted elevator</strong>. The facility is vast, spanning numerous levels. Each level is completely different and hides its own challenges, surprises and dangerous entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You don\u2019t know what awaits in the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But you will \u2014 soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/fdc15420b3902483af295efff544c08c.avif?t=1752598678\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/68db13095efe871a0fcead17a7a1dd2d.poster.avif?t=1752598678\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/68db13095efe871a0fcead17a7a1dd2d.webm?t=1752598678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/68db13095efe871a0fcead17a7a1dd2d.mp4?t=1752598678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are equipped with a <strong>photo camera</strong> and a high-tech objective-finding device known as <strong>S.E.R.A</strong> (<strong>Spectral Emission Recognition Apparatus)</strong> \u2014 capable of detecting nearby objects with fingerprints or fresh blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your task: <strong>find and photograph every clue</strong> that could help the investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/1c7817f7ffaa61ee9cd3b1aff276db21.avif?t=1752598678\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout your descent, you\u2019ll need to solve <strong>puzzles</strong>, uncover new <strong>challenges</strong>\u00a0and gather <strong>equipment</strong> to go deeper. There are <strong>collectibles</strong>\u00a0and other secrets scattered along the way. Every level may bring you closer to the truth \u2014 or further into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you reach the bottom you\u2019ll know everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You <strong>must</strong> do this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no other way.</p>","developers":["Lazaganye"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/5b33f63eff5cfb729c4c3e8d82e2bfcca8784497/header.jpg?t=1752598678","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Lazaganye. All Rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257128347,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128347/movie480.mp4?t=1745937591","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128347/movie_max.mp4?t=1745937591"},"name":"Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257128347/1cc2a00b3c207799cae56069117ab17e2c0c17e4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745937591","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128347/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745937591","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128347/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745937591"}}],"name":"Final Descent","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 